WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- All right.

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.310
I have one more story.

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:04.020
I hope will leave a smile on your face.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:04.853
This is #WhatI'mLiking

00:00:04.853 --> 00:00:06.588
(introduction jingle)

00:00:06.588 --> 00:00:08.376
A Tennessee police officer

00:00:08.376 --> 00:00:10.792
on a routine patrol
came across this sight;

00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:14.499
an 84 year old grandmother
walking down a busy highway.

00:00:14.499 --> 00:00:17.096
Turns out she was headed
to a hair appointment

00:00:17.096 --> 00:00:19.345
but the bus only took her so far.

00:00:19.345 --> 00:00:21.027
Who is this bus driver?

00:00:21.027 --> 00:00:23.310
(audience laughs)

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.891
Just inquiring minds want to know.

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:27.603
Of course, the officer gave her a ride.

00:00:38.791 --> 00:00:39.630
(audience laughter and applause)

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:42.660
- Even better than two
of since become friends.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.805
So let's welcome them, say hello to Elle

00:00:44.805 --> 00:00:47.010
and Officer Lance Hoffmeiser of the

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.693
Murphys Police Department.

00:00:48.693 --> 00:00:49.526
Hello!

00:00:49.526 --> 00:00:50.435
- Lance.

00:00:50.435 --> 00:00:51.967
- How are y'all doing today?

00:00:51.967 --> 00:00:54.541
First of all, Elle,
your hair looks amazing.

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:55.669
- Thank you.

00:00:55.669 --> 00:00:56.858
(laughter)

00:00:56.858 --> 00:01:01.410
- So do you normally walk
to your hair appointments?

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:02.243
- Well, no.

00:01:02.243 --> 00:01:04.757
I take a car or a bus part-way.

00:01:04.757 --> 00:01:08.589
It happened to be a
little different that day.

00:01:08.589 --> 00:01:12.330
- You got, so you got some
exercises and steps in as well.

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:13.500
I, I love this though.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:15.990
So Officer Lance, you're
now friends, right?

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:18.595
- Yeah, we, we have a
little funny banter together

00:01:18.595 --> 00:01:20.813
and we're able to text every now

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:24.115
and again and I check on her every week.

00:01:24.115 --> 00:01:27.096
She's since moved to North Carolina and

00:01:27.096 --> 00:01:30.180
uh, my wife and I actually
plan on, on taking

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:31.679
a trip down to see her.

00:01:31.679 --> 00:01:33.720
So we're super excited about that.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:35.845
But I'm also sad that she moved away.

00:01:35.845 --> 00:01:38.413
But I mean, like I said in the beginning,

00:01:38.413 --> 00:01:39.246
um,

00:01:39.246 --> 00:01:42.378
she reminded me of my
grandmother right away

00:01:42.378 --> 00:01:44.193
and I, I just, you know

00:01:44.193 --> 00:01:45.780
I always wanna check on her

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:47.400
make sure she's doing all right.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:50.093
- Yeah. So Elle, is your new hair salon,

00:01:50.093 --> 00:01:52.380
'cause you moved to North Carolina,

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.720
Is your new hair salon
a little bit closer?

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:57.011
- Well, it is a little harder to get

00:01:57.011 --> 00:01:58.847
to because it's in the middle

00:01:58.847 --> 00:02:02.088
of a whole lot of other little shops, but,

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:03.029
- Oh,

00:02:03.029 --> 00:02:03.862
- Closer.

00:02:03.862 --> 00:02:05.814
- Okay, okay, well first of all

00:02:05.814 --> 00:02:08.310
I just want y'all to know I'm
liking your post right now.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.222
That's the one thing.

00:02:09.222 --> 00:02:11.602
But I ask about your salon, Elle,

00:02:11.602 --> 00:02:15.507
because our season long
partner, Pilot Pin makers of G2

00:02:15.507 --> 00:02:18.240
the go-to pin at the Kelly
Clarkson Show, want to

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:21.167
make sure you always have a
ride to your hair appointment.

00:02:21.167 --> 00:02:22.857
So they're gonna be writing you a check

00:02:22.857 --> 00:02:23.690
for a thousand dollars
that you can use for Ubers.

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:26.523
(audience cheers)

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:30.143
- There you go.

00:02:30.143 --> 00:02:30.976
- That's amazing.

00:02:30.976 --> 00:02:31.809
Thank you.

00:02:31.809 --> 00:02:32.760
- Uber away.

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:34.620
And depending on where
you are in North Carolina

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:35.730
I have a lot of family there.

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:36.690
They might give you a ride.

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:38.220
Just lemme know where you are.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:39.104
They're friendly.

00:02:39.104 --> 00:02:40.089
You can trust them.

00:02:40.089 --> 00:02:41.889
Well, thank you guys so much

00:02:41.889 --> 00:02:44.020
and thank you to all our guests this hour.

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:45.931
Jay Leno, Iowa, Devery di

00:02:45.931 --> 00:02:49.386
and the Bad Moms of Comedy
or Lee, Leah and Co.

00:02:49.386 --> 00:02:50.760
Y'all have a great day and if it's not,

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.473
well, try and change it.

